Covid was also a time I was watching a lot fo Bojack Hoseman and decided to make keychains of Diane and Bokack and obviosuly print them also:
![3DprinitingRoll28](/images/3Dprinting/3dprintingRoll28.jpg)

A minato Kunai Knife, model downloaded off of thingiverse, and printed and apinted it for my brother:
